# web domain (ADR-014)
# Shared by: personal / untrusted / disposable — they differ only in
# properties (network/persistence/identity), not in this package set.
firefox-esr
foot
pcmanfm
# Added for app_sandbox (2026-10-06), which runs on this layer: software the
# user brings from outside KatMate, from user space only. It arrives as
# tarballs, extracted AppImages (--appimage-extract) and static binaries, so
# the layer carries the extractors and the Wayland platform plugins that such
# a Qt program needs. An AppVM's only display is Wayland (waypipe), and
# without the plugin Qt falls back to xcb and aborts (vault.list, ai4).
# vm-agent sets QT_QPA_PLATFORM=wayland for every RUN child (R146), and a
# program started from foot inherits it. These also reach app_web and
# app_personal, which share the layer. No python3, no pip, no sudo (ruling
# of 2026-10-06). xz-utils is listed even if the foundation already carries
# it, so this layer does not depend on that.
qtwayland5
qt6-wayland
unzip
xz-utils
